* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_uc (reference/crafted.toml, 5 Nov 2026): demo12 variant 2,
* dispatching and unit commitment (docs/demo12-variants.md), added to TIMES_Demo demo12
* (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). Features in release order (Version.log):
* - REG1 ELCTEGAS00, linear dispatch: ramping (v3.7.0, Aug 2014: ACT_UPS UP/LO/FX,
*   eqactups.vda EQ_CAPLOAD, EQ_ACTRAMP) and the dispatch features of v3.9.0 (Oct 2015):
*   start-up costs (ACT_CSTUP: EQ(l)_ACTUPS), minimum on/off hours and cycles (ACT_TIME:
*   EQL_ACTUPC), partial loads (ACT_MINLD, ACT_LOSPL: EQ_ACTPL), ramping costs
*   (ACT_CSTRMP: EQ_ACTRMPC).
* - REG2 ELCTEGAS00, unit commitment by start-up type (v3.9.7, Jul 2016; announced in
*   v4.0.0): ACT_CSTSD, ACT_SDTIME, ACT_MAXNON, ACT_LOSSD with ACT_MINLD and ACT_TIME
*   (eqlducs.vda: eq_sdlogic, eq_sudupt, eq_sdslant, eq_sdminon, eq_sudload, eq_sudtime,
*   eq_sudpll). Linear (LP): the discrete variant needs $SET DUC YES and a MIP.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
ACT_UPS ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.UP 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.LO 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.FX 0.25
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL.FX 0.3

/

PARAMETER
ACT_MINLD ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00 0.3
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00 0.4

/

PARAMETER
ACT_LOSPL ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.FX 0.1
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.FX 0.05

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTUP ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.DAYNITE.MEURO05 0.02

/

PARAMETER
ACT_TIME ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.UP 6
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.LO 6
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.N 200
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.UP 4
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.LO 4

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTRMP ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.UP.MEURO05 0.001
REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.LO.MEURO05 0.001

/

PARAMETER
ACT_CSTSD ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT.UP.MEURO05 0.01
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.WARM.UP.MEURO05 0.02
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.COLD.UP.MEURO05 0.04
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT.LO.MEURO05 0.005

/

PARAMETER
ACT_SDTIME ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT.UP 2
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.WARM.UP 4
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.COLD.UP 8
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT.LO 1

/

PARAMETER
ACT_MAXNON ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT 8
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.WARM 48

/

PARAMETER
ACT_LOSSD ' '/
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT.UP 0.2
REG2.2005.ELCTEGAS00.HOT.LO 0.2

/
